    "sections": {
        "description": "Stoat is a clean, minimal and lightweight WordPress blog theme for personal blogs, writers, authors, creators and newsletters. Free starter demos import in a few clicks, from food, travel and lifestyle blogs to fashion, photography and book blogs. What makes it different? (1) Fast: no page builder, self-hosted fonts only (no Google Fonts) and one small script. (2) Accessibility and SEO friendly. (3) Modern native Gutenberg editor. (4) Many options in the native WP Customizer: three header layouts, a left or right sidebar, list or stacked posts, colors, fonts and a dark header skin. Live preview: https://stoat.owldraft.com"
    },
